        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Stop Worrying About How You Won't Get AIDS</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 60px 50px;\n            max-width: 900px;\n            color: #111;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            position: relative;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        .top-columns {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            font-size: 20px;\n            line-height: 1.15;\n            letter-spacing: -0.3px;\n        }\n        .column {\n            width: 48%;\n        }\n        .column p {\n            margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n        }\n        .main-heading {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 82px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            line-height: 0.85;\n            letter-spacing: -2.5px;\n            margin: 50px 0;\n        }\n        .how-you-can {\n            width: 55%;\n            margin: 0 auto 60px auto;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n        }\n        .how-you-can p {\n            margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n        }\n        .bottom-section {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            gap: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 80px;\n        }\n        .hotline-info {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: auto auto;\n            row-gap: 4px;\n            column-gap: 20px;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;\n            margin-top: 5px;\n        }\n        .hotline-info .label {\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n        .america-responds {\n            background-color: #222;\n            color: white;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            letter-spacing: 4px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            width: 170px;\n        }\n        .america-responds div {\n            padding: 8px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #fff;\n        }\n        .america-responds div:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n        .footer {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-top: 40px;\n        }\n        .footer-text {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 9px;\n            text-align: left;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n        }\n        .footer-text strong {\n            font-size: 10px;\n        }\n        .placeholder {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            background-color: #f5f5f5;\n            border: 1px dashed #aaa;\n            color: #555;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            font-family: sans-serif;\n        }\n        .logo-hhs {\n            width: 45px;\n            height: 45px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n        }\n        .logo-cdc {\n            width: 70px;\n            height: 35px;\n        }\n        .corner-text {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 30px;\n            left: 50px;\n            font-size: 8px;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"top-columns\">\n        <div class=\"column\">\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from everyday contact.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from being a friend.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a mosquito bite.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a kiss.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS by talking.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS by listening.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a public pool.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a pimple.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a toilet seat.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a haircut.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS by donating blood.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from an airplane.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from tears.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from food.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a hug.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a towel.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a telephone.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a crowded room.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"column\">\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from an elevator.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a greasy spoon.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a bump.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS by laughing.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS by watching a movie.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a cat.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a schoolyard.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from going to a party.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from taking a trip.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a dog bite.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from visiting a city.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a cab.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a bus.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS at a play.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS by dancing.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS because someone is<br>different from you.</p>\n            <p>You won't get AIDS from a classroom.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h1 class=\"main-heading\">\n        Stop Worrying About<br>\n        How You Won't Get AIDS.<br>\n        And Worry About<br>\n        How You Can.\n    </h1>\n\n    <div class=\"how-you-can\">\n        <p>You can get AIDS from sexual intercourse<br>with an infected partner.</p>\n        <p>You can get AIDS from sharing drug<br>needles with an infected person.</p>\n        <p>You can get AIDS by being born to an<br>infected mother.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-section\">\n        <div class=\"hotline-info\">\n            <div class=\"label\">NATIONAL AIDS HOTLINE:</div>\n            <div>1-800-342-AIDS</div>\n            <div>Servicio en Espanol:</div>\n            <div>1-800-344-7432</div>\n            <div>TTY-Deaf Access:</div>\n            <div>1-800-243-7889</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"america-responds\">\n            <div>AMERICA</div>\n            <div>RESPONDS</div>\n            <div>TO AIDS</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder logo-hhs\" title=\"U.S. Department of Health & Human Services Seal\">[Seal: HHS]</div>\n        <div class=\"footer-text\">\n            <strong>U.S. DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH & HUMAN SERVICES</strong><br>\n            Public Health Service\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder logo-cdc\" title=\"CDC Logo\">[Logo: CDC]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"corner-text\">NAIEP 10/91 P110</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
